cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use EQUAL, please cite it as below.
title: "EQUAL: Turn Real API Traffic into a Local Sandbox and OpenAPI"
authors:
  - family-names: Balanov
    given-names: Anton
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-04
url: https://balanov.pro/equal/
repository-code: https://github.com/Balanov/equal
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: >-
  EQUAL records real application HTTP traffic into a redacted JSONL cassette,
  serves it as a local API, generates an OpenAPI 3.1 document, and verifies
  another implementation with semantic, field-level differences.
keywords:
  - local API sandbox
  - OpenAPI
  - record and replay
  - offline development
  - contract testing
  - differential testing
